	<string>This app uses Bluetooth to connect with nearby devices and enhance your event experience.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>This app needs access to your camera to scan QR codes for event check-in and to enable video features in web content.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>This app uses your location to show nearby venues and provide location-based event information.</string>
